From: Ayushman Chhabra <14110965+ayushmanchhabra@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 10:41:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Credit Node.js from third_party/node-nw

licenses.py only knew NW's old third_party/node path, so the credits
page skipped Node.js.

Refs: nwjs/nw.js#8384
---
 tools/licenses/licenses.py | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/tools/licenses/licenses.py b/tools/licenses/licenses.py
index cef4caa9..ee3ca3e3 100755
--- a/tools/licenses/licenses.py
+++ b/tools/licenses/licenses.py
@@ -207,6 +207,11 @@ SPECIAL_CASES = {
     "URL": "https://iojs.org",
     "License": "MIT",
   },
+  os.path.join('third_party', 'node-nw'): {
+    "Name": "Node.js",
+    "URL": "https://nodejs.org",
+    "License": "MIT",
+  },
   os.path.join('third_party', 'cros_system_api'): {
     "Name": "Chromium OS system API",
     "URL": "https://www.chromium.org/chromium-os",
-- 
2.43.0

